Package: kayoutf
Title: Kayou Transformers Trading Card Database
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Philipp", "Thoss", , "ph.thoss@gmx.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4672-2792"))
Description: A comprehensive, queryable database of all Kayou Transformers
    trading cards across all known sets (TF01, TF02, TF03, TFH01, TFO01,
    TF40Y, TFEU01). Data is stored as Parquet files and queried via DuckDB,
    with convenience functions returning tibbles.
